# Force LF line endings for all text files, regardless of each contributor's
# local `core.autocrlf` setting (Windows Git defaults often convert LF -> CRLF
# on checkout, which oxfmt then flags as a formatting violation).
#
# An explicit `eol=lf` attribute takes precedence over `core.autocrlf` during
# checkout, so this fixes the issue for every contributor/OS going forward —
# not just locally for one machine.
* text=auto eol=lf
